{"4131480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gallipoli Trenches: The Forgotten Front WW1", "steam_appid": 4131480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4153980], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔮 WISHLIST OUR UPCOMING DARK FANTASY GAME!</strong><br>Search for “Potions &amp; Passions: Therapist for Monsters” right here on Steam to add our brand-new cozy monster therapy simulator to your Wishlist! Your support means everything to our indie studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/695f2ddbad549c013190c75b037768c3.avif?t=1782333196\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>“War takes everything from us... Yet sometimes, it gives us someone to protect.”</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/e424f6927ba4ac02a571be5f6e41d601.poster.avif?t=1782333196\" aria-label=\"Gallipoli_Trenches4\" width=696 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/e424f6927ba4ac02a571be5f6e41d601.webm?t=1782333196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/e424f6927ba4ac02a571be5f6e41d601.mp4?t=1782333196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>“War takes everything from us... Yet sometimes, it gives us someone to protect.”</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/e424f6927ba4ac02a571be5f6e41d601.poster.avif?t=1782333196\" aria-label=\"Gallipoli_Trenches4\" width=696 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/e424f6927ba4ac02a571be5f6e41d601.webm?t=1782333196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/e424f6927ba4ac02a571be5f6e41d601.mp4?t=1782333196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Forgotten Front. A Lost Child. A Fading Hope.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallipoli Trenches: The Forgotten Front</strong> is a deeply emotional, story driven 2D adventure set during the Gallipoli Campaign of World War I. While history focuses on armies, this journey focuses on a single promise: keeping a child alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Captain Timur</strong>, a weary Ottoman officer serving under <strong>Mustafa Kemal Atatürk</strong>. When you discover a lone surviving child in a devastated village, your mission shifts from fighting a war to guiding a shattered soul through the chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique Perspective:</strong> Experience the Great War through the eyes of the Ottoman Army. Witness the untold stories of the &quot;other side&quot; of history, inspired by real soldier letters and historical accounts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect &amp; Survive:</strong> This is not just a war game; it's an escort mission of the heart. Evade enemy patrols, navigate through dangerous gas clouds, and keep the child safe at all costs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles:</strong> Use your wits to clear paths through destroyed villages and collapsing tunnels. Every puzzle solved brings you one step closer to safety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Atmosphere:</strong> Immerse yourself in the sun-scorched landscapes of 1915. From the claustrophobic trenches to the majestic Bosphorus mines, experience a unique 2D visual style that brings the era to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/bd03d443a54c5b7c3308de583c932555.poster.avif?t=1782333196\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/bd03d443a54c5b7c3308de583c932555.webm?t=1782333196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/bd03d443a54c5b7c3308de583c932555.mp4?t=1782333196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Journey Through History</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the sun-scorched cliffs of Gallipoli to the rain-soaked tunnels beneath the front lines, relive one of the most unforgettable moments of the First World War.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound by duty and compassion, Captain Timur must guide the girl through the chaos of collapsing trenches, burning hillsides, and shattered souls. Through moments of silence, kindness, and sacrifice, discover that even in war, humanity remains the strongest weapon of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/7ce6ab5a2cfb99ed7191b92302851a94.poster.avif?t=1782333196\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131480/extras/7ce6ab5a2cfb99ed7191b92302851a94.webm?t=1782333196\" typ